# 7. Environment Configuration

## 7.1 Runtime Portability Configuration

`batmanoverlay` strictly operates in **Portable Mode**. No registry entries are created, and no files are written to `%APPDATA%` or `%LOCALAPPDATA%`.

```python
# Boot isolation logic in src/app.py
def get_portable_data_dir() -> Path:
    """Determine the portable data directory relative to executable."""
    if getattr(sys, "frozen", False):
        # Running as PyInstaller executable
        base_dir = Path(sys.executable).parent
    else:
        # Running from source
        base_dir = Path(__file__).parent.parent

    data_dir = base_dir / "data"
    data_dir.mkdir(exist_ok=True)
    return data_dir
```

